# Architecture reference

## Workspaces

- `apps/portal`: public registration and personal portal.
- `apps/admin`: authenticated administrative dashboard.
- `packages/api`: AWS Lambda/API Gateway handlers with Firebase Admin,
  Stripe, and Resend integrations.
- `packages/shared`: shared TypeScript contracts, constants, labels, and
  branding.

## Data flow

The browser calls the API for registration, payment, administration, and
mutations. Firebase Admin is used only by the API. Firebase Client is limited to
approved authentication and real-time projections. Stripe webhooks are the
payment source of truth; Resend sends transactional/admin email.

## Optional modules

The generated feature flags and `docs/agent/project-manifest.json` identify which
of playeras (`tshirt`), talleres (`workshops`), hospedaje (`rooms`), and
votaciones (`voting`) are enabled for this project.
